# No midi-qol

Do not use, detect, hook into, or depend on the **midi-qol** module in any way.

- Do not check `game.modules.get("midi-qol")` or similar
- Do not register `midi-qol.*` hooks
- Do not call MidiQOL APIs, workflows, or helpers
- Do not add midi-qol-specific code paths or fallbacks

Implement features against **Foundry core** and the **dnd5e** system only.
